   "e": "0ozzzvzuypxnhm0xyxxpsewrttqonvohrqe00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "In a canyon of old oil billboards, something steps into the road. A dinosaur, wearing the seal of the State. Stryder slams the brakes.",
   "see": [
