  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "STRYDER"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Citizen-dinosaur! By authority of the Governor and the Board of Regents, stand down!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v05.wav",
   "d": 5.25,
   "e": "09ztywxpyorxsuzyvswwuwmzyqrpicouqti30000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The dinosaur does not move. So the Ranger reaches for the one weapon he trusts: a megaphone, and an old argument from Plato's Republic.",
   "see": [
    "a man speaking through a megaphone",
    "an old book lying open"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v06.wav",
   "d": 9.925,
   "e": "0zyxxyzq07zyxwwuxwwwtk0zwypyxvxuvwxtuc00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vertrek-dok-tandjong-priok-naar-nederlands-indi/clips/0000517040-0000527400.mp4",
     "in": 0.5,
     "dur": 10.36,
     "src": "Vertrek dok Tandjong Priok naar Nederlands-Indië",
     "y": 1923,
     "q": "a man speaking through a megaphone",
     "fit": 0.293
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/1c5b02f7-87bb-5b3e-9c3d-a6758f606490/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/eca67fca-b4a2-5bc7-bb6c-48ab2da53e1f.mp4",
     "in": 3.0,
     "dur": 21.19,
     "src": "Belmont Historical Society Presents: Richard Betts Remembers, PART II ",
     "y": 2006,
     "q": "an old book lying open",
     "fit": 0.312
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Okay. Fine. We’re doing this. Justice, according to the wise, is the advantage of the stronger!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v07.wav",
   "d": 5.975,
   "e": "0vpzovxvzyzujc0wmulszqvyujoxpupnnurj0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "is he trying to argue with it?",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/good-eating-habits/clips/0000276510-0000300000.mp4",
   "in": 6.84,
   "d": 2.35,
   "said": "He just poked at it.",
   "src": "Good Eating Habits",
   "y": 1951
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "T-REX"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "Correct.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v10.wav",
   "d": 1.236,
   "e": "000000009bcb9rvuuusvzzzzwspj900000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Correct?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v11.wav",
   "d": 1.15,
   "e": "000000003vxwzzzywsh004hg7100000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "I am stronger. Therefore, justice benefits me.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v12.wav",
   "d": 4.511,
   "e": "00ezvslzzuplzwcutlnw8p6uuin4qpf200000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "No, no, what I mean is, the stronger should protect the polis. The polis has… vibes.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v13.wav",
   "d": 5.85,
   "e": "0ozxzxwyzwqqozvwpoqltuha0ozxsuqcewmg9000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "Your vehicle contains fuel. Fuel is advantage. I will take the advantage.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v14.wav",
   "d": 6.111,
   "e": "00zzzqxxucyuo0vyynixtn80spygpptgb3000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "That’s not— that’s not how—",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v15.wav",
   "d": 1.95,
   "e": "0000ayylmnzzzoazxsilyumpusmjg30000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "It is exactly how you described it.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v16.wav",
   "d": 3.811,
   "e": "000qzxxpnzzjrumxurrmjefusrahd00000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "well, he walked right into that one",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/e0dfeb30-42f3-5457-b6a9-bc2d249b303b/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/f77f2cd8-b770-5558-ae87-b851a500af15.mp4",
   "in": 1.08,
   "d": 2.53,
   "said": "He's got one little hole below him.",
   "src": "AOPA - ASF: Do the Right Thing! Decision Making for Pilots",
   "y": 2007
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "RUBY",
   "text": "BABY! He just got out-Plato’d by a reptile!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v18.wav",
   "d": 2.7,
   "e": "000tzwzzsusttyqxo6wwvmvuqun6nkb000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Wait! Plato also says reason should rule appetite!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v19.wav",
   "d": 3.275,
   "e": "00bzp0tzzvxvlwmynpyrwstmtzutpkdof0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "My reason is hungry.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v20.wav",
   "d": 3.086,
   "e": "0004rzxsxzzrtxsioc9dvtrmluof200000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The dinosaur bites the front of the jeep clean off. Stryder rolls out into the dust, and the gang behind him cheers it like a lesson.",
   "see": [
    "a crushed car in the desert",
    "young men cheering beside motorcycles"
   ],
   "mood": "something breaking apart",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v21.wav",
   "d": 9.05,
   "e": "0zywvtsxwxozu50lzyxxvvwk0vzwwxxoytuxpe00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/4c3fd6d8-a652-58ef-81f3-feeee8689715/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/94e2d4e5-f8db-5763-b72b-0a0204741297.mp4",
     "in": 17.0,
     "dur": 25.43,
     "src": "Nature's Cameo: Bryce Canyon National Park",
     "y": 1930,
     "q": "a crushed car in the desert",
     "fit": 0.291
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/317317cc-3ea8-5c52-ba08-ef5a38b8f516/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/3682484f-eb4d-5d4f-be36-2fbdb53c78cf.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 16.38,
     "src": "All-American Soap Box Derby (1936)",
     "y": 1936,
     "q": "young men cheering beside motorcycles",
     "fit": 0.326
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Okay. Okay. You win. You’re the stronger. Congratulations on your… jurisprudence.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v22.wav",
   "d": 5.525,
   "e": "0sqzvxszswzvystxslwwutyuwvwvm0owkukhd000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "T-REX",
   "text": "Thank you.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v23.wav",
   "d": 1.186,
   "e": "0000000000000vzzzxwvvo0cfrstsonurkf60000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "So this is what Thrasymachus meant.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v24.wav",
   "d": 2.475,
   "e": "0003xyzzjvowx06vzyjqwwsjqhqtng4000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Then a State drone floats down overhead with a recorded message. Dinosaurs are a noble lie. Please disperse calmly.",
   "see": [
    "a small aircraft hovering in the sky",
    "a loudspeaker on a pole"
   ],
   "mood": "dread",
   "wav": "pilot/ep14/v25.wav",
   "d": 8.525,
   "e": "0xvwyywqzxynytyyuo70vywuyzxyt0uzvvuyrd00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/4be191d1-daba-5d36-ba75-0fc99ce754d4/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/18a7939e-2bb2-5492-a37f-34f2de93e5af.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 7.54,
